check returns 0. Pin correct. Good.\n\nTest `test_wrong_checker_exit_2`:\n- write pin wrong. Expect 2.\n\nTest `test_hand_time_set_reads_hand_ledger`:\n- job ledger with line `{\"event\":\"freeze\",\"at\":\"...\",\"bar_file\":\"custody/bar.md\",\"bar_sha256\":\"...\",\"writer\":\"hand\"}`.\n- custody.json with `{\"bar\":{\"frozenAt\":\"...\",\"file\":\"custody/bar.md\",\"approvals\":[]}}`.\n- call V.hand_time_set(job, ledger, custody, record, evidence). Expect entry field bar.frozenAt source ledger-hand.\nBut function may need record. Pass `{\"predicate\":{\"x-plumbline\":{}}}`.\n\nTest `test_events_missing_generation`:\n- ledger with generation open line writer tool.\n- record xp.generations empty.\n- call V.check_events(job, ledger, record, {}) -> contains kind events.\nNeed check_events signature.\n\nTest `test_spend_mismatch`:\n- ledger with spend line key_delta 1.0, spend_ledger path maybe nonexistent. record xp.spend calls_sum 2.0, key_delta 1.0, total 2.0, tolerance. No calls. Expected calls_sum 0.0 -> mismatch. check_spend returns spend.\n- Need create spend ledger file? check_spend may try read if spend line exists. Create empty file. Key reading file with read_at/writer and last_settle_at None. Good.\n\nTest `test_shadow`:\n- record xp with inputs {\"verdict\":\"accept\",\"hand_times\":[...]}, xp.verdict \"accept\", xp.hand_times same. But derived hand_times empty -> shadow. Need pass hand_times empty to check_shadow. We'll design signature `check_shadow(job, ledger, record, all_calls, hand_times)`. Then call.\n- Expect kind shadow.\n\nTest `test_no_emit_import`: read source.\n\nTest `test_schema_hand_times_string`: record with xp schema correct, hand_times \"bad\". Expect 4 schema.\n\nTest `test_schema_unknown_key`: xp has \"extra\": 1. Expect 4 schema.\n\nNeed ensure tests don't depend on actual `tools/pin.json` in repo. Our `find_pin` prefers custody/tools/pin.json. Good.\n\n### Potential issues with verifier and real held-out\n\nNeed exact standard che