"\n```\nRun `--check` on target existing. Check no files written. Then run write. Check contents.\nTest malformed missing END exit 1 and nothing written.\nTest duplicate path exit 1.\nNeed target dir exists.\n\n### tests/test_edi_judge_batch.py\n\nNeed create items 3, job spend, mock, rubric, log. Run judge_batch batch 2. Our or_call auto-zero baseline (mock usage 0). No init needed. Good.\n- `--tag test/fp8 --pin-provider test`.\n- `--mock-transport`.\n- `--log td/harness-judge.log` -> seat derived \"judge\". or_call log name starts with harness-judge. Good.\n- `--out td/out`.\n- `--job-spend`.\n- `--items`, `--batch 2`, `--rubric`.\n- `--model test/model`.\nExpect return 0. Summary order rotated left by 1: if items ids [\"a\",\"b\",\"c\"], batch 2 -> [\"b\",\"c\",\"a\"]. Results length 3, each exit 0, reply_file exists. Check summary writer. Check requests.jsonl has 3 POST chat. Good.\n\nPotential issue: Our judge_batch writes messages files into out; summary files list? No. Fine.\nPotential issue: or_call `--call` name `batch2_b`. Good.\nPotential issue: or_call log entry call. Fine.\nPotential issue: `--out` reply path. Good.\n\nNeed maybe test batch 1 order unchanged? Not necessary.\n\n### tests/test_edi_stamps.py\n\nMaybe combine I1. Test fixture_run and judge_batch stamps already. Or_call spend status stamps. Could have separate test. But we already have. Need at least one new test file per part? We have multiple.\n\nNeed ensure tests don't depend on `tools/edi/__init__.py`. We use subprocess.\n\nNeed ensure tests pass if run from any cwd. We use ROOT from __file__.\n\nNeed ensure no test writes outside temp. Good.\n\n## Potential hidden test interactions with existing tests\n\nExisting tests may import `tools/edi/or_call.py`? They might run `tests/validate_schemas.py` which may call emitter, not our tools. Our files won't affect.\n\nNeed ensure our tests don't fail if `tools/edi/or_call.py` not executable? We call via sys.executable. Good.\n\nNeed ensure she