a ledger line behind it — that's fine, the flag just has no source. recomp empty, got non-empty → flag-without-source. Also `if recomp:` false → no allowance needed. Then shadow: hand_times differ → shadow. First flag-without-source. ✓\n\nHmm wait — will the schema validate the hand_times entry? `handTime` requires field/file/line/source with types; line integer|null ✓.\n\nNow the events fixture. Ledger:\n\n```json\n{\"event\": \"generation\", \"action\": \"open\", \"seat\": \"maker\", \"n\": 1, \"prompt_file\": \"custody/prompt.md\", \"prompt_sha256\": \"000...\", \"at\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z\", \"writer\": \"kit/custody_ledger.py@0123456789ab\"}\n{\"event\": \"generation\", \"action\": \"close\", \"seat\": \"maker\", \"n\": 1, \"outcome\": \"done\", \"fix_kind\": null, \"at\": \"2026-01-01T00:10:00Z\", \"writer\": \"kit/custody_ledger.py@0123456789ab\"}\n```\n\nRecord omits `generations`. check_events: expected = [two lines with source], got None → events. Then open/close: maker_calls empty → events. Same kind. ✓\n\nAlso, does `hand_time_set` care? generation → `else: continue`. ✓\n\n`check_shadow`: xp lacks generations → skipped. Other arrays [] = []. ✓\n\nRelay fixture. Ledger:\n\n```json\n{\"event\": \"relay\", \"kind\": \"relay\", \"quote\": \"Ship it.\", \"from\": \"BuyerBot\", \"source_chat\": \"chat-1\", \"source_at\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z\", \"at\": \"2026-01-01T00:01:00Z\", \"writer\": \"kit/custody_ledger.py@0123456789ab\"}\n```\n\nRecord:\n```json\n{\n  ...,\n  \"predicate\": {\n    \"bar\": {\"approvals\": [{\"role\": \"relay\", \"by\": \"BuyerBot\", \"at\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}]},\n    \"x-plumbline\": {\n      \"schema\": ...,\n      \"hand_times\": [],\n      \"generations\": [], \"evaluations\": [],\n      \"relays\": [{\"event\":\"relay\",\"kind\":\"relay\",\"quote\":\"Ship it.\",\"from\":\"BuyerBot\",\"source_chat\":\"chat-1\",\"source_at\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"at\":\"2026-01-01T00:01:00Z\",\"writer\":\"kit/custody_ledger.py@012345